    activationBorderColor: "#4a5568"
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Org Admin
    participant Cloud as context.help Cloud
    participant Node as Self-Hosted Node
    participant OIDC as OIDC Provider

    Note over Admin,OIDC: Node Enrollment Flow

    Node->>Node: Generate or load<br/>long-lived identity key

    Admin->>Cloud: Request node enrollment<br/>for org: acme-corp

    Cloud->>Cloud: Generate enrollment token<br/>scoped to org: acme-corp

    Cloud-->>Admin: Enrollment token:<br/>tok_enroll_abc123xyz

    Admin->>Node: Configure node with<br/>enrollment token

    Node->>Cloud: POST /api/v1/nodes/enroll<br/>Authorization: Bearer tok_enroll_abc123xyz<br/>{<br/>  "node_id": "node-5678",<br/>  "public_key": "...",<br/>  "org_id": "acme-corp"<br/>}

    activate Cloud

    Cloud->>Cloud: Validate enrollment token
    Cloud->>Cloud: Verify org scope

    Cloud->>Cloud: Create node record in org

    Cloud->>Cloud: Sign configuration payload:<br/>{<br/>  "node_id": "node-5678",<br/>  "org_id": "acme-corp",<br/>  "issuer": "https://auth.context.help",<br/>  "allowed_claims": [...],<br/>  "audit_endpoint": "...",<br/>  "metering_endpoint": "..."<br/>}

    Cloud-->>Node: 201 Created<br/>{<br/>  "status": "enrolled",<br/>  "config": {...},<br/>  "signature": "..."<br/>}

    deactivate Cloud

    Node->>Node: Verify signature
    Node->>Node: Store trust configuration locally

    Node->>Node: Start emitting:<br/>- Status heartbeats<br/>- Audit events<br/>- Metering data

    Node->>Cloud: POST /api/v1/nodes/status<br/>{<br/>  "node_id": "node-5678",<br/>  "status": "healthy",<br/>  "version": "1.2.3"<br/>}

    Cloud-->>Node: 200 OK

    Note over Admin,OIDC: Node enrolled and trusted.<br/>Org admin can manage via cloud dashboard.
```
